Vnum            9499
Name            下層裂谷階~
Description
石階貼著裂谷內壁向下盤旋，腳邊偶爾會掠過一絲像流光又像霧影的淡線。再往更下方看去，只剩被冷光吞掉的深黑空間，像祕境真正的底層仍遠未結束。
~
SectorType      SECT_INSIDE

#Exit
Direction       UP
ExitVnum        9498
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Exit
Direction       DOWN
ExitVnum        9501
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Enquire
Keyword         退路~
End

#Enquire
Keyword         下方~
End

End
